# The synthetic corpus IS committed (data/raw + data/manifest.yaml): it is
# fictional, small, and committing it means a reviewer can clone and run without
# installing a Thai font to regenerate the PDFs. Regenerate with `make dataset`.
#
# The SQLite knowledge base is derived from it, so it is not.
